  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/cf6e319e-a94d-45d2-9fb0-a94dde30dcb6-image.png\" style=\"width: 260px; height: 185px;\" /><br /><br /><math><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">tan</mi></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><msup><mrow><mn>30</mn></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">h</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>&#8467;</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mrow></math><br /><br /><math><mi>&#8467;</mi><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">h</mi><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></math><br /><br /><math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">W</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">PQ</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#956;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi><mi>&#8467;</mi></math> or <math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">W</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">QR</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#956;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></math><br /><br /><math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#956;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi><mi>&#8467;</mi><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#956;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></math>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;<math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>&#8467;</mi></math><math><mo>&#8776;</mo><mn>3.5</mn><mi>m</mi></math><br /><br /><math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></math></p><p>now according to work energy theorem</p><p>&nbsp;<math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">W</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mo>&#8710;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi></math><br /><br /><math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">h</mi><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#956;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi><mi>&#8467;</mi><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#956;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math><br /><br /><math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">h</mi><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#956;</mi><mi>&#8467;</mi><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#956;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#956;</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>&#8467;</mi><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mspace linebreak=\"newline\"></mspace><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#956;</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>2</mn><mrow><mi>&#8467;</mi><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>2</mn><mrow><mn>4</mn><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mn>2</mn><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfrac><mo>&#8776;</mo><mn>0.29</mn></math></p>",
